<title>USA: Salomon Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Salomon Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr primary		$1.98		    $1.42</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.83		     1.32</p>
<p> Net			228,000		  168,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,212,000		2,375,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     108,100		  105,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     120,700		  120,600</p>
<p>NOTE: Net is before preferred dividends.</p>
<p>Net available for fully diluted earnings per share was $221 million vs $163 million.</p>
<p>Revenues are total revenues, before interest expense. After interest expense, revenues were $1.05 billion vs $826 million.  </p>
<p>	 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$7.88		    $3.64</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$7.23		     3.50</p>
<p> Net			907,000		  457,000</p>
<p> Revs		   9,002,000		8,933,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     106,400		  106,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     120,900		  124,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net is before preferred dividends.</p>
<p>Year net available for fully diluted earnings per share was $875 million vs $437 million.</p>
<p>Revenues are total revenues, before interest expense. After interest expense, revenues were $4.28 billion vs $3.15 billion.</p>
</text>
